# Frame is relative to E2E arrange completion when --stage-e2e is used.
# Columns: frame player key-mask(hex). Masks are native GBA KEYINPUT bits.
# SELECT+L+R starts the native ROM link experiment on each side.
2 0 304
2 1 304
5 0 000
5 1 000
# Different movement on each cartridge after link establishment.
180 0 010
210 0 000
220 1 020
250 1 000
